"""
bd-ai-harness — Unified Multi-Harness CLI & Agent Integration Launcher (Argon-4 + Live Web Tools)
Supports:
  1. claude           (bd-claude-local)     — Claude Code CLI via Anthropic /v1/messages on LiteLLM (:4000)
  2. codex            (bd-codex-local)      — Codex CLI via boylenet local provider (:4010/v1 & :4000/v1) + full web access
  3. opencode         (bd-opencode-local)   — OpenCode / Aider / Continue local provider (:4000/v1 & :4010/v1)
  4. hermes           (bd-hermes-local)     — Native Hermes / Qwythos / Qwen3 Agentic Tool-Calling Loop (bash/file/web_search/web_fetch)
  5. deepseek         (bd-deepseek-local)   — DeepSeek <think> Reasoning + Code + Web Tool Runner (R1-70B, V4-Flash, V3-671B)
  6. openrouter-local (bd-openrouter-local) — Local OpenRouter-Compatible Gateway Client with Auto-Tier Routing & Web Tools

Enforces the Argon-4 Anti-Sycophancy & Anti-Hallucination System Prompt Contract and PreToolUse Hooks
(~/.claude/settings.json, ~/.codex/hooks.json, bd-token-guard.py, shield.py) across all 6 harnesses.
"""

